4. BACKGROUND WORK / MULTITASKING (how the app stays responsive)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Frontend upload queue: 3 concurrent workers; uploads continue while the user
  navigates/chats; per-file status queued -> uploading -> indexing -> done;
  queue lives in the shared workspace store so it survives navigation.
- Backend indexing: off the request path (Celery task / daemon thread / inline
  for serverless), bounded concurrency at stage 2.
- Real-time: Django Channels WebSockets for team chat (no polling).
- Streaming: chat replies stream line-by-line (fetch reader).
- Rate limiting per endpoint/user/IP protects shared capacity.

